<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντλος</span></b> , ὁ, in <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			1.92
		</span></i> also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντλον, τό</span>:—in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold of a ship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.411
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.479
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bilge-water,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις . . ἄντλον οὐκ ἐδέξατο</span>
			let in no <i>water,</i> metaph. for 'let no enemy come in', <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				796
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντλον εἴργειν ναός</span>
			pump out <i>water</i> from a ship, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				691
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄντλον ἐμβαίνειν
			πόδα,</span> metaph. for getting into a difficulty, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a
			<i>flood</i> of water, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλίμενον ὥς τις εἰς ἄντλον πεσών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1025
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἄντλῳ τιθέναι</span>
			<i>scuttle, sink,</i> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					8.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bucket,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Man.
				6.424
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>heap of corn,</i> threshed but not yet cleansed, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				114
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				546
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.352
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.258
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adaeus</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
